Package: memeplotr
Type: Package
Title: Flexible 'ggplot2' Visualisation of 'MEME Suite' Motif Output
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("First", "Last", email = "you@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Reads 'MEME Suite' XML output (MEME, STREME, DREME) into tidy data
    frames and renders publication-quality motif composition diagrams, sequence
    logos, presence/absence heatmaps and co-occurrence plots with 'ggplot2'.
    Motif maps can be aligned to a phylogeny supplied as a Newick file, with the
    tree drawn in pure 'ggplot2' so that colours, block shapes, labels, scales
    and themes remain fully user-modifiable. A 'shiny' application exposes the
    same grammar interactively and emits the equivalent 'ggplot2' code for
    reproducibility.
